{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は京都で握手会だったんだけど、めっちゃ髪型褒められた！ありがと！みんな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そ！おだんごにしたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-8.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0001-8.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、おだんご切れちゃう、なかなかうまく撮れん..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0002-5.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"角度変えてるのに撮れない...くそっ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0003-5.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ手伸ばしたけど、これが限界でした、そしてあまりお団子感伝わらず...ごめん...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、この枚数の多さから、試行錯誤はしたんだなと理解してください...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーカーもほめられた、わたし変に女の子らしい服着るよりカジュアルな服着た方がみんな喜んでくれること多い、わーいこのパーカー人と被らんやつー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もみんなありがとねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近お茶にはまってるから自分土産にお茶買って帰りまーすヾ(｡･ω･｡)"}],"source":"archive"}